### How do I get a price for my car?
[Request a free quote](/#quote) or WhatsApp a few photos to 07495 400369. John will call you with a tailored price.', '/images/john-muriel-founder-ecoverde-van.webp', 'published', '2026-10-09T09:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-09T09:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-09T09:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover, status, created_at, updated_at, published_at) VALUES ('mobile-car-wash-ealing-eco-friendly', 'Mobile Car Wash Ealing: Eco-Friendly Washes at Home', 'Eco-friendly mobile car wash in Ealing — water use compared, our four wash packages and how to book a wash at home, at work or on the street.', 'Ealing has some of London''s most car-heavy streets — and a growing number of drivers who would rather not queue at a hand car wash or drive to a jet-wash bay. A **mobile car wash in Ealing** brings everything to you: at home, outside the office or wherever the car is parked.

Here is how an eco-friendly mobile wash works, why it is gentler on your car and the planet, and which package to book.

![Snow foam being sprayed over a car before a hand wash](/images/snow-foam-pre-wash-cta.webp "pH-neutral snow foam lifts dirt before anything touches the paint.")

## How much water does a car wash use?

Water use varies enormously depending on how the car is washed. Published UK figures put the comparison like this:

| Wash method | Typical water use per car |
|---|---|
| Hand car wash | 100–300 litres |
| Automatic machine wash | 150–400 litres (some recycled) |
| Steam wash | 5–15 litres |
| Rinseless / waterless wash | Around 5–20 litres |

Source: [Get Car Clean — eco car wash options in the UK](https://www.getcarclean.com/blog/eco-car-wash-uk). Figures are typical ranges, not exact measurements.

At Ecoverde we use **low-water and waterless techniques, steam and biodegradable products**, so there is no foamy run-off going into Ealing''s drains — and our electric van means no generator fumes either.

> **Good to know:** "eco-friendly" is not a regulated term. Ask what products a valeter uses and what happens to the waste water — not just how many litres they use.

## Our mobile car wash packages

| Package | What''s included | Best for |
|---|---|---|
| Exterior basic wash | Snow foam and hand wash, wheels and tyres, hand dry | A quick, safe exterior clean |
| Exterior + interior wash | Basic wash + interior vacuum, dash and glass wipe | Weekly or fortnightly upkeep |
| Premium wash & shine | Exterior + interior + tyre dressing and spray sealant | Extra gloss and protection |
| Full wash & refresh | Premium + door shuts, sills, mats and interior refresh | The most complete wash |

Every package is quoted to your car — [see our mobile car wash service](/services/mobile-car-wash) or [request a free quote](/#quote).

## Why a hand wash is safer than a brush wash

Automatic brush washes and shared sponges drag grit across the clear coat, which is how most swirl marks are created. Our wash method is designed to avoid that:

1. **Snow foam pre-wash** softens and lifts dirt.
2. **Two-bucket method** — one bucket for shampoo, one to rinse the mitt — keeps grit off the paint.
3. **Soft wash mitts**, never brushes or sponges, on painted surfaces.
4. **Separate tools for wheels** so brake dust never touches the bodywork.
5. **Microfibre drying** for a spot-free finish.

If your paint is already swirled, ask about [paint correction](/services/paint-correction).

## Where we wash in Ealing

We cover all of Ealing (W5, W13), plus [Hanwell](/areas/hanwell), [Acton](/areas/acton), [Perivale](/areas/perivale) and [Chiswick](/areas/chiswick) — from residential streets around Ealing Broadway to office car parks near Ealing Common. See our [Ealing area page](/areas/ealing).

## Regular washes on a schedule

Most Ealing customers book a wash every one to four weeks. Our [maintenance packages](/services/maintenance-packages) handle the scheduling, with reminders before every visit, so the car is always clean without you having to think about it.

## Frequently asked questions

### Do you need my water or electricity?
No. Our electric van is fully self-contained, so we can wash your car on the street, at work or in a car park.

### Is a mobile car wash safe for my paint?
Yes — we use snow foam, the two-bucket method and soft mitts, which are far gentler than automatic brush washes or shared sponges.

### Can you wash my car at work in Ealing?
Yes, as long as we can safely access the car. Many customers book a wash while they are in the office.

### How often should I wash my car?
Every one to two weeks keeps most cars looking their best and makes each wash quicker. Ceramic-coated cars benefit from regular, gentle washes.

### How do I book a mobile car wash in Ealing?
[Request a quote online](/#quote), WhatsApp us on 07495 400369, or call. We work 7 days a week, 7am–8pm.', '/images/snow-foam-pre-wash-cta.webp', 'published', '2026-10-03T09:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-03T09:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-03T09:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, body, cover, status, created_at, updated_at, published_at) VALUES ('car-detailing-kensington-notting-hill', 'Car Detailing in Kensington & Notting Hill', 'Mobile car detailing in Kensington, Notting Hill and Holland Park — supercar and classic care, paint correction, ceramic coating and soft-top proofing.', 'Kensington and Notting Hill are home to some of London''s most special cars — supercars, classics, convertibles and immaculate daily drivers — usually parked on the street or in a mews. They need more than a quick wash. **Mobile car detailing** brings specialist, paint-safe care to your door, without the cars ever leaving the postcode.

We work across W8, W11, W14 and SW7 from our [Ladbroke Grove (W10) base](/areas/ladbroke-grove), just minutes away.

![Red Porsche Taycan valeted on a residential street beside the Ecoverde van](/images/porsche-taycan-valet-at-home.webp "A Porsche Taycan detailed at the owner''s home.")

## Valeting vs detailing: what''s the difference?

| | Valeting | Detailing |
|---|---|---|
| Goal | Clean the car thoroughly | Correct, enhance and protect |
| Paint | Wash and protect | Decontaminate, machine polish, coat |
| Interior | Vacuum, steam, shampoo | Plus leather, Alcantara and fine trim care |
| Time | Hours | Hours to days |
| Best for | Regular upkeep | Prestige, classic and show cars |

## Detailing services for prestige cars

| Service | What it involves | Price |
|---|---|---|
| [Supercar detailing](/services/supercar-detailing) | Multi-stage, paint-safe detail, wheels, aero and interior | From £289 |
| [Classic car detailing](/services/classic-car-detailing) | Gentle care for original paint, chrome and leather | Free tailored quote |
| [Paint correction](/services/paint-correction) | Machine polishing to remove swirls and restore gloss | From £189 |
| [Ceramic coating](/services/ceramic-coating) | Long-term gloss and protection | From £289 |
| [Leather & upholstery](/services/leather-upholstery) | Clean, condition and protect leather and Alcantara | Free tailored quote |
| [Soft-top cleaning & proofing](/services/soft-top-cleaning) | Deep clean, re-colour and reproof fabric roofs | From £189 |

## Caring for supercars and classics

Supercars often have soft paint, complex aero and delicate finishes; classics may have single-stage paint and original chrome. Both need a careful, least-aggressive approach:

- Dedicated mitts, wheel brushes and pH-neutral products
- Inspection under detailing lights before any polishing
- Test spots to find the gentlest method that works
- Hand-applied protection suited to the paint type
- Careful leather and interior care — never harsh all-purpose cleaners

> **Tip:** for cars stored long-term or used only at weekends, a ceramic coating or quality sealant makes dust and pollen far easier to remove safely.

## Convertibles: soft-top cleaning and reproofing

Fabric roofs trap dirt, moss and algae, and lose their water repellency over time. Guidance from roof-care specialists is to deep clean at least twice a year — spring and autumn — and reproof after cleaning or at least once a year, especially for cars parked outside ([Classic Car Hub](https://classiccarhub.co.uk/classic-car-soft-top-care-guide/); [Ultramar](https://www.ultramarxl.com/en/blogs/blog/roadmap-cabriodak-cleaning-and-impregnating)). Pressure washers can damage seams, so roofs should always be cleaned by hand.

![Convertible soft-top roof half cleaned, showing the before and after](/images/soft-top-roof-before-after.webp "A soft-top roof part-way through cleaning.")

## Detailing on the street and in mews

Most of our Kensington and Notting Hill work is kerbside or in mews and residential garages. Because our electric van is fully self-contained and silent, there is no generator noise and no run-off — important on quiet residential streets.

## Areas we cover nearby

[Notting Hill](/areas/notting-hill), [Kensington](/areas/kensington), [Holland Park](/areas/holland-park), [South Kensington](/areas/south-kensington), [Chelsea](/areas/chelsea), [Shepherd''s Bush](/areas/shepherds-bush), [Maida Vale](/areas/maida-vale) and [Ladbroke Grove](/areas/ladbroke-grove). See [all areas](/areas).

## Frequently asked questions

### Can you detail a supercar on the street?
Yes, weather permitting. For multi-stage paint correction or coatings we may recommend a garage or covered space so the paint stays clean and dry while we work.

### Do you detail classic cars?
Yes. We use gentle, test-spot-first methods and classic-safe waxes to preserve original paint, chrome and interiors.

### How long does a full detail take?
From several hours for an enhancement detail to a day or more for multi-stage paint correction with a ceramic coating.

### Do you clean Alcantara and leather?
Yes — leather is cleaned, conditioned and protected, and Alcantara is cleaned with dedicated products. See [leather & upholstery](/services/leather-upholstery).

### How do I get a detailing quote?
[Request a free quote](/#quote) or send photos on WhatsApp to 07495 400369. For paint work we may ask for close-ups in daylight.', '/images/porsche-taycan-valet-at-home.webp', 'published', '2026-09-26T09:00:00.000Z', '2026-09-26T09:00:00.000Z', '2026-09-26T09:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO NOTHING;
